{"code":"002800","name":"신신제약","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1959년 의약품 제조 및 판매업을 위해 설립되었으며, 2017년 코스닥시장에 상장되었음. 의약품 전문 제조·판매 회사로서 첩부제, 물파스, 에어파스 등에 특화되어 있으며, 약 100여 종의 OTC 의약품을 생산·판매하고 있음. 전국 주요 거점에 영업지점을 운영 중이며, 소매약국 1만3천여 곳과 직거래하며 동남아, 아시아, 유럽으로 수출 확대하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":4260.0,"open":4320.0,"high":4320.0,"low":4190.0,"volume":16256,"amount":69250560.0,"ret_1d":-1.6166,"gap":-0.2309,"range_pct":3.0516,"ret_5":-1.7301,"ret_20":-4.162,"ret_60":0.2353,"ret_120":-27.0548,"ret_250":-22.4044,"ma20":4419.75,"ma60":4429.0,"ma120":4655.6667,"ma200":5084.85,"close_vs_ma200":-16.2217,"close_vs_ma60":-3.8158,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":17.2197,"r2_60":0.1028,"slope_120":-37.4051,"r2_120":0.4266,"slope_250":-26.25,"r2_250":0.5294,"high52":6990.0,"low52":3900.0,"pos_52w":11.6505,"dd_52w":-39.0558,"mdd_1y":-39.4419,"atr14_pct":4.0158,"vol_ann_60":26.9071,"vol_avg20":23336.65,"vol_ratio20":0.6966,"vr5":0.4672,"vr20":0.2043,"amount_avg5":121394320.0,"amount_avg20":103211012.25,"amount_avg60":268808255.0,"obv_chg20":1.0715,"turnover_20":3.0766,"pv_eff_20":-1.3528,"rsi14":40.1611,"frgn_net_5":15363.0,"inst_net_5":-9379.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.1013,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0618,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0394,"frgn_net_20":2619.0,"inst_net_20":-19749.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0173,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.1302,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.1129,"frgn_net_60":-144269.0,"inst_net_60":-24294.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.951,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.1601,"smart_net_60_pct":-1.1111,"frgn_net_120":-395961.0,"inst_net_120":-3117.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-2.6101,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0205,"smart_net_120_pct":-2.6306,"foreign_ratio":3.72,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-1.11,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":41.0,"op_margin_q":12.0588,"op_qoq":28.125,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":86.3636,"rev_yoy":14.8649,"op_trend_4q":0.5479,"fin_period":"202606","roe":18.28,"debt_ratio":79.28,"per":4.8,"pbr":0.82,"div_yield